  "releaseNotes": "# Version 2.1.0\n\n\t\t\t## Breaking Changes\n\t\t\t- Removed `PcmFormat` and use `WaveFormat` instead\n\t\t\t- Removed `DsdFormat` and handle by sample rate instead\n\t\t\t- Removed `DsdFormat` property from `DsdReader`\n\t\t\t- Removed `ratio` parameter from `DopProvider` constructor\n\t\t\t- Removed automatic DSD conversion functionality from `DopProvider`\n\t\t\t- Removed `Htaps` static filter\n\t\t\t- Replaced `PcmFormat` and `bits` with `WaveFormat` in `PcmProvider` parameters\n\t\t\t- Added `maxConversionStep` parameter to `PcmProvider` constructor\n\n\t\t\t## What's New\n\t\t\t- Added new `SampleFloat64Resampler` class to resample PCM-64bit float\n\t\t\t- Added new `MultiStageResampler` class to multi-stage resample\n\n\t\t\t## Bug Fixes\n\t\t\t- Fixed `DsdReader` stream position does not reach the audio data length\n\t\t\t- Fixed `DsdHeader` incorrect data when read DSDIFF header",
